2(5 - x) <= 3x < 37 - 5x.', '4', 'From 2 <= x < 37/8 (= 4.625), the integers are 2, 3 and 4.
The largest integer is 4.', 'Easy', '{"tags":"sass-2022-p1,q6b","subtopic":"Compound inequalities","question_type":"open","diagram_required":false}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-03T15:48:09.169Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-03T15:48:09.169Z'::timestamptz) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO bridging.questions (id, topic_id, prompt, model_answer, explanation, difficulty, metadata, diagram_path, question_type, answer_tolerance, accepted_answers, case_sensitive, require_simplified_form, require_units, required_unit, accepted_units, marking_notes, syntax_migration_status, syntax_migration_notes, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('01a067f4-c378-7a2f-8da9-5ca58ef6a638'::uuid, '019f9df7-a2a2-7853-96ff-2c02dc5e1f10'::uuid, 'p is proportional to q^3. It is known that p = 24 for a particular value of q.

Find the value of p when this value of q is halved.', '3', 'p = kq^3, so 24 = kq^3.
When q is halved: p = k(q/2)^3 = kq^3 / 8 = 24 / 8 = 3.', 'Medium', '{"tags":"sass-2022-p1,q7a","subtopic":"Direct proportion","question_type":"open","diagram_required":false}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-03T15:48:09.208Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-03T15:48:09.208Z'::timestamptz) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO bridging.questions (id, topic_id, prompt, model_answer, explanation, difficulty, metadata, diagram_path, question_type, answer_tolerance, accepted_answers, case_sensitive, require_simplified_form, require_units, required_unit, accepted_units, marking_notes, syntax_migration_status, syntax_migration_notes, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('01a067f4-c38d-7286-90b8-22b3b5d3db84'::uuid, '019f9df7-a2a2-7853-96ff-2c02dc5e1f10'::uuid, 'y is inversely proportional to x^2. y = 4 when x = 3.

Find y when x = 10.', '0.36', 'y = k / x^2, so 4 = k / 9 and k = 36.
When x = 10: y = 36 / 100 = 0.36.', 'Medium', '{"tags":"sass-2022-p1,q7b","subtopic":"Inverse proportion","question_type":"open","diagram_required":false}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-03T15:48:09.229Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-03T15:48:09.229Z'::timestamptz) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;